# Build-time configuration for the React client.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset for same-origin setups:
#   - local development (the Vite proxy forwards /api to localhost:4000)
#   - single-origin deployment (the API serves the built SPA itself)
#
# Set it when the SPA and the API are on different hosts, e.g. the SPA on
# Vercel and the API on Render. No trailing slash. The value must also appear
# in the API's CORS_ORIGIN allowlist, and the API host must support WebSocket
# upgrades for the live occupancy feed.
# VITE_API_URL=https://flexospaces-api.onrender.com
